  "summary": "Malicious code in lunubet-casino (npm)",
  "details": "An inert npm package that ships an empty module (module.exports = {}) and a French-language README promoting a casino site (lunubetcasinofr[.]fr). It contains no executable payload, no lifecycle scripts, no dependencies, and no network activity — it functions purely as SEO/spam content advertising the casino. Published as part of a broader campaign of casino-promotion packages.",
